Subject: [PATCH 040/140] fix(player): restore configured speed after gesture

Use the user-defined default speed when unlocking the hold-speed gesture. Restore missing Compose imports for tinted sliders and the browser action bar.
---
 .../gyrolet/mpvrx/presentation/components/TintedSliderItem.kt  | 3 ++-
 .../gyrolet/mpvrx/ui/browser/components/FloatingBottomBar.kt   | 1 +
 .../com/quantummpv/app/ui/player/controls/GestureHandler.kt     | 2 +-
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/app/src/main/java/com/quantummpv/app/presentation/components/TintedSliderItem.kt b/app/src/main/java/com/quantummpv/app/presentation/components/TintedSliderItem.kt
index f156d3db..21982c16 100644
--- a/app/src/main/java/com/quantummpv/app/presentation/components/TintedSliderItem.kt
+++ b/app/src/main/java/com/quantummpv/app/presentation/components/TintedSliderItem.kt
@@ -28,8 +28,9 @@ import androidx.compose.ui.graphics.Color
 import androidx.compose.ui.hapticfeedback.HapticFeedbackType
 import androidx.compose.ui.platform.LocalHapticFeedback
 import androidx.compose.ui.tooling.preview.Preview
-import com.quantummpv.app.ui.theme.spacing
+import androidx.compose.ui.unit.dp
